 "titulo": "He crossed his name out of Hell 🐒 Sun Wukong Part 3 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "8-TON STAFF",
 "descripcion": "Every mortal sword shatters in Wukong's hand, so he marches to the bottom of the East Sea, steals the Dragon King's eight-ton iron pillar, and erases his name from the Book of Life and Death.\n\n> Part 4: {when_next}.\nWould you have dared to rob both the sea and the Underworld?\n\nFrom Journey to the West (Xiyouji), Wu Cheng'en, 16th century, chapters 2 and 3.\n#monkeyking #sunwukong #journeytothewest #mythology #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Wukong tore the demon apart, cutting him in two with his own *sword*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Yet every mortal blade felt like dry *twigs* in his hands.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He parted the *East Sea* and marched into the Dragon King's palace.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Heavy blades *snapped*; a giant nine-pronged fork felt like a toy.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Terrified, the Dragon Queen pointed to the *iron pillar* holding the sea floor.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "*Yu the Great* had driven that column down to tame the Great Flood.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At Wukong's touch it blazed: *thirteen thousand five hundred jin*, eight tons.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "*Smaller!* Wukong barked, and the pillar shrank into an iron staff.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He shrank it to a *needle* in his ear and took golden armor.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Back home, Wukong drank until he collapsed—and woke in *chains*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Two wardens had dragged his soul to the *Underworld*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Wukong pulled the needle from his ear and *crushed* them flat.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The *Ten Kings* knelt in terror and brought the Book of Death.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "It read: *Sun Wukong*, fated to die at three hundred forty-two.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He *crossed out* his name and every monkey's name in ink.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Now the Sea and Hell begged *Heaven* for war. Part four, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
